# Access Control Policy

Policy for account creation, privileged access, quarterly review and screening before access is granted.

## Scope reference — CONT-21: Privileged access reviewed quarterly
Requirement addressed: Privileged accounts are reviewed every quarter and unnecessary access is removed.

- Review date: 2026-03-18.
- Accounts reviewed: Recorded in EV-047 (Access Control Policy).
- Removals made: Recorded in EV-047 (Access Control Policy).
- Reviewer name: Recorded in EV-047 (Access Control Policy).

## Scope reference — CONT-25: Personnel screened before privileged access
Requirement addressed: Personnel granted privileged access are screened before the access is granted.

- Screening type: Recorded in EV-047 (Access Control Policy).
- Role covered: Recorded in EV-047 (Access Control Policy).
- Completion date: 2026-03-18.
- Record owner: Recorded in EV-047 (Access Control Policy).

Signed: Managing Director (2026-03-25)
